{"resourceIdentifier":"5366","resourceName":"Henan Zhumadian Youran Xiping Dairy Farm Biogas Utilization Project","description":"Henan Zhumadian Youran Xiping Dairy Farm Biogas Utilization Project  (hereinafter referred to as “the Project”) is locates in Hongcunpu Village, Leizu Town, Xiping County, Zhumadian City, Henan Province, P.R China. \r\nThe project is to build a centralized anaerobic animal manure treatment system which collects manure waste from dairy cows from Zhumadian farm in Xiping County. The project uses animal manure waste as ferment material to produce biogas in the Completely Stirred Tank Reactor (CSTR) type anaerobic digesters. The recovered biogas will be used for electricity generation at the project site. The residual waste from the CSTR digesters will be used to produce organic fertilizer at the project site.\r\nThe baseline scenario is the situation where, in the absence of the project activity, the animal manure waste are left to decay within the project boundary and methane is emitted to the atmosphere. The project is expected to avoid GHG emission of methane through recovery and destruction of biogas.","location":{"latitude":33.416665,"longitude":113.701666},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-12-19","endExclusive":"2025-01-19","endInclusive":"2025-01-18"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5366"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Zhumadian Youran Animal Husbandry Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 021-23019950"},{"type":"string","value":"3542346576@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"59610"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME"